	I'm sorry, but this game cheats!  :)  I was a 13th level Valkerie,
bopping around on Dlvl26, with random teleportation from eating a 
leprechaun corpse.  I teleport into a dark room next to a '@', identifing
it as Medusa.  She's standing on the downstaircase, too.  OK, I'm set; 

Possible spoiler ahead...



I apply the mirror in her direction...

The Medusa is tired and doesn't look into your mirror--more--
The Medusa hits!  The Medusa hits!--more
You turn to stone...--more--

	I've never heard of that one before.  She doesn't look...great...
and I thought this was a sure kill.  Just thought I'd warn anyone else
of this way of being killed by Medusa.  Is a shield of reflection the
only "sure" fire way to get rid of her?

There goes +7 Excalibur, gauntlets of power, crystal plate mail, a cloak
of invisibility, a load of food and wands/scrolls of teleportation, and 
a bunch of useful and necessary intrinsics.  Sniff.  :(  It was a personal
best, at least.

	Until next time...
